    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 124 (Tuesday, July 30, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. CARAVEO:\nH.R. 9194.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nConstitutional Authority--Necessary and Proper Clause (Art.\nI, Sec. 8, Clause 18)\nTHE U.S. CONSTITUTION\nARTICLE I, SECTION 8:\nPOWERS OF CONGRESS\nCLAUSE 18\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo amend the Research and Development, Competition, and\nInnovation Act to support nucleic acid screening, and for\nother purposes.\n[Page H4963]\n</pre>",
